        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    sofr_changes = [0.014, 0.016, 0.018, 0.020, 0.022]\n    notional_principal = 1_000_000\n    fixed_rate = 0.025\n    basis_points = 0.0035\n    years = 5\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_gain_loss = 0\n\n    for year in range(years):\n        variable_rate = sofr_changes[year] + basis_points\n        annual_gain_loss = notional_principal * (variable_rate - fixed_rate)\n        total_gain_loss += annual_gain_loss\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(total_gain_loss)\n```",
